<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADS ENDS AT $41-1/4 (FIM 188.38).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADS ENDS AT $41-1/4 (FIM 188.38).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADS closed $0-5/8 lower at $41-1/4 in New York on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Its Wall Street closing equals about 188.38 markka. In Helsinki on Tuesday Nokia closed up 2.50 markka at 191.00.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADS (two shares) fell $0-5/8 to $32-5/8 on Wall Street overnight. The price equals about 74.50 markka. In Helsinki, Valmet closed down 0.80 markka to 75.00.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADS was untraded in New York after closing at $20-7/8 (94.05 markka) on Monday. In Helsinki, Rauma closed unchanged at 94.50 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-0-680 50 245</p>
